{"unit_id":"forrestahha__dsh-voice-input#feature-1","repo":"forrestahha/dsh-voice-input","commit":"76c1c5acbb9cc51584e14199d4fc588a4699f965","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-input 的功能「microphone-control」：麦克风按钮位于 DSH 对话输入区右侧，点击后开始连续语音识别，再次点击停止；浏览器不支持识别或输入阶段不可编辑时按钮禁用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:8-15","src/client/VoiceInputButton.tsx:74-77","src/client/VoiceInputButton.tsx:122-140"]}
{"unit_id":"forrestahha__dsh-voice-input#feature-2","repo":"forrestahha/dsh-voice-input","commit":"76c1c5acbb9cc51584e14199d4fc588a4699f965","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-input 的功能「live-draft」：语音识别的实时结果会与开始听写时的草稿合并，并通过输入区的 setDraft 更新当前草稿；插件不会代替用户发送消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/VoiceInputButton.tsx:85-100"]}
{"unit_id":"forrestahha__dsh-voice-input#feature-3","repo":"forrestahha/dsh-voice-input","commit":"76c1c5acbb9cc51584e14199d4fc588a4699f965","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-input 的功能「language-and-spacing」：识别语言沿用浏览器语言，缺失时回退到 zh-CN；转写拼接会避免中日韩文字间多余空格，并保留拉丁文字的单词间隔。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/VoiceInputButton.tsx:72-73","src/client/speech.ts:63-78"]}
{"unit_id":"forrestahha__dsh-voice-input#feature-4","repo":"forrestahha/dsh-voice-input","commit":"76c1c5acbb9cc51584e14199d4fc588a4699f965","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-input 的功能「recognition-feedback」：界面检查标准及 WebKit 前缀语音识别接口；不支持时禁用麦克风，识别期间展示状态，权限、网络等错误会转成中英文提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/VoiceInputButton.tsx:74-83","src/client/VoiceInputButton.tsx:94-108","src/client/speech.ts:91-103"]}
{"unit_id":"forrestahha__dsh-voice-input#caveat-1","repo":"forrestahha/dsh-voice-input","commit":"76c1c5acbb9cc51584e14199d4fc588a4699f965","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-input 使用浏览器提供的 Web Speech API；浏览器供应商可能处理语音音频，具体行为由浏览器决定，代码未指定服务域名。 (见 src/client/VoiceInputButton.tsx:88-100)","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/VoiceInputButton.tsx:88-100"]}
